  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "２０メートルさきの　ミガルーサが　はなつにおいも　かぎとってすなのなかに　みを　かくすのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "20m 떨어진 가비루사에게서 나는 냄새도 맡을 수 있어서 모래 속에 몸을 숨긴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "就算身處於２０公尺外，牠都能嗅出輕身鱈散發出的氣味，躲進沙子裡面藏身。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il détecte l’odeur de Délestin à plus de vingt mètres, ce qui lui donne le temps de s’enfouir dans le sable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann den Geruch eines Agiluza auf 20 m Entfernung wahrnehmen und versteckt sich daraufhin flugs im Sand.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede percibir el olor de los Veluza a 20 m de distancia, lo que le permite ocultarse bajo la arena a tiempo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fiuta l’odore di un Veluza da 20 metri di distanza e si nasconde nella sabbia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon can pick up the scent of a Veluza just over 65 feet away and will hide itself in the sand.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "２０メートル先の　ミガルーサが　放つ匂いも　嗅ぎとって砂の中に　身を　隠すのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "就算身处２０米之外，它也能嗅出轻身鳕散发出的气味，然后躲进沙子里藏身。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede percibir el olor de los Veluza a 20 m de distancia, lo que le permite ocultarse bajo la arena a tiempo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ディグダに　にるが　まるで　べつのしゅるい。　せいそく　かんきょうに　てきおうしてぐうぜん　にたらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "디그다를 닮았지만 전혀 다른 종류다. 서식하는 환경에 적응한 결과, 우연히 닮게 되었다는 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然長得像地鼠，但卻是完全不同的種類。據說是為了適應生活環境，才偶然變得相像。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa ressemblance fortuite avec Taupiqueur serait le fruit d’une adaptation à son milieu. Malgré leur similarité, ils ne sont pas de la même espèce.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es erinnert an Digda, ist jedoch eine völlig andere Art. Offenbar ist durch die Anpassung an seine Umwelt eine zufällige Ähnlichkeit entstanden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aunque se parezca a un Diglett, se trata de una especie distinta. El parecido es el resultado fortuito de su adaptación al entorno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Malgrado la sua somiglianza con i Diglett, fa in realtà parte di una specie diversa che ha assunto quest’aspetto per adattarsi al proprio habitat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Though it looks like Diglett, Wiglett is an entirely different species. The resemblance seems to be a coincidental result of environmental adaptation.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ディグダに　似るが　まるで　別の種類。　生息　環境に　適応して偶然　似たらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽与地鼠相似，却是完全不同的种类。据说是为了适应生活环境，才偶然变得相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aunque se parezca a un Diglett, se trata de una especie distinta. El parecido es el resultado fortuito de su adaptación al entorno.",
